   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>Update<br>Dear all problem was in the line</p>\r\n<pre><code><span>facet_grid</span><span>(~</span><span>count</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>switch</span><span>=</span><span>&quot;y&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> space </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;free_x&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> scales </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;free_x&quot;</span><span>)</span></code></pre><div>\r\nBut if I remove it, I lose the number of cases in each group, that I would like to avoid.</div><div><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/BPQm9BIcQnL9w6vDBEET-nGAXqN1UQ5wHDunhcqTeE2wiKXS-44VahMfTu8Arg1FcZ9uEX2f=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.stack.imgur.com/UEw0I.png\" alt=\"https://i.stack.imgur.com/UEw0I.png\"></div>Well, I have found the solution. I have removed the line with <code>facet_grid</code> and added some modifications to keep these numbers at the top of the graph. First, I tried to duplicate the x-axis using <code>sec_axis</code> to add the numbers of patients in each group on the secondary axis. But doesn&#39;t work because the x-axis was discrete and <code>sec_axis</code> works only with continuous axes. Then, I have tried simple <code>geom_text</code>, adding some modifications with <code>coord_cartesian</code> and <code>plot.margin</code>. So, the added modifications are:\r\n<pre><code><span>+</span><span>geom_text</span><span>(</span><span>aes</span><span>(</span><span>label</span><span>=</span><span>count</span><span>,</span><span> y</span><span>=</span><span>Inf</span><span>),</span><span> vjust</span><span>=</span><span>-0.5</span><span>,</span><span> size</span><span>=</span><span>5</span><span>)+</span><span>\r\ncoord_cartesian</span><span>(</span><span>clip </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;off&quot;</span><span>)+</span><span>\r\ntheme</span><span>(</span><span>plot.margin </span><span>=</span><span> margin</span><span>(</span><span>20</span><span>,</span><span>15</span><span>,</span><span>15</span><span>,</span><span>15</span><span>,</span><span> unit </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>&quot;pt&quot;</span><span>))<br></span></code><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jZv1jFZ4MtRV6RyPYHRedth6SNlL8ZdftlA2LDHz5C8rGWDIaax7frscUbqmUEyMjBOQvRzR=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.stack.imgur.com/1hXDh.png\" alt=\"https://i.stack.imgur.com/1hXDh.png\"><br><code><span></span></code></pre><br>вторник, 7 июля 2020 г., 17:17:14 UTC+2 пользователь Jakhongir Alidjanov написал:</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi everyone!</div><div><br></div><div>I am trying to label the ticks on the x-axis using the following line of code: <br><pre><code><span>scale_x_discrete</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;Results of the urine culture&quot;</span><span>,</span><span> labels</span><span>=</span><span>c</span><span>(</span><span>expression</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;&lt;&quot;</span><span>~</span><span>10</span><span>^</span><span>4</span><span>~</span><span>&quot;CFU/ml&quot;</span><span>),</span><span> expression</span><span>(</span><span>10</span><span>^</span><span>4</span><span>~</span><span>&quot;-&quot;</span><span>~</span><span>10</span><span>^</span><span>5</span><span>~</span><span>&quot;CFU/ml&quot;</span><span>),</span><span> expression</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;&gt;&quot;</span><span>~</span><span>10</span><span>^</span><span>6</span><span>~</span><span>&quot;CFU/ml&quot;</span><span>)))<br></span></code>The graph returns with the same value (the first in the expression, i.e.  &quot;&lt;10^4 CFU/ml&quot;) for all three ticks (see the graph below). I have tried to find an answer using \r\nsearch but did not find the description of this problem. Could you please point out what is wrong with this code?\r\nThanks in advance.<br><br>Yours truly,<br>Jakhongir<br><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/3ae602b101079/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"\"><br><code><span></span></code></pre></div></div></blockquote></div>"
